% Certain skeleton of case N2v2 (part O7), written by hand: confidences dropped,
% priorities kept as ranks, Skolem terms as constants. Question: mayEnter(nora).
member(nora).
membershipOf(m1, nora).
suspended(m1).
mayEnter(X) :- member(X), unless(-mayEnter(X), 1).
-mayEnter(X) :- member(X), membershipOf(M, X), suspended(M).
query(mayEnter(nora)).
